cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, code, or Y-maze design, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Data, code, and Y-maze design for: Honey bees show no olfactory preference for sodium-enriched nectar"
abstract: >-
  Data, R analysis code, and laser-cut Y-maze design files for a behavioral
  study testing whether western honey bees (Apis mellifera) show an olfactory
  preference for sodium-enriched artificial nectar.
authors:
  - given-names: Sully
    family-names: Harrer
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sully-harrer/honey-bee-sodium-olfaction"
keywords:
  - Apis mellifera
  - honey bee
  - olfaction
  - sodium
  - Y-maze
  - foraging behavior
version: 1.0.0
